            "text": "Alberto has built three AI agents:\n\n- **Fraud Detection Agent (deployed):** Reviews newly published events and organizers on an online ticketing platform and recommends approve, reject, or request-info for a human admin. On the reference set, the deployed model, Claude Haiku 5.5, reached 92% accuracy, approved 0% of fraud, and costs about $0.002 per review. Tech: TypeScript, PostgreSQL, GCP.\n- **Organizer Support Agent (coming soon):** Will answer organizers' questions about sales, payouts and setup by pulling live data from PostgreSQL and the payments API. It is not built yet.\n- **Portfolio Agent (personal project):** The agent answering questions on this site. It is also exposed as an MCP server. Source and eval report are on GitHub.\n\nAlberto also follows practices such as offline evals before shipping, human-in-the-loop decisions, and tracked cost and limits. Ask if you'd like details on any of these.",
